<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/Ap/tr/_x5f_ap_x7e__x7e_h0_x5f_07_x5f_pari/2> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%положить конец, дать насытиться%}: {#BIma paryApnuhi#}\n<ls>MBH. 15,1073.</ls> — <ab>part.</ab> {#paryApta#} {%исполненный, завершенный, достигший полной меры, достигающий высокой меры, просторный, полный, достаточный, удовлетворительный%}: {#kAmAnyaH kAmayate manyamAnaH #}\n[Page1-0652]\n{# sa kAmaBirjAyate tatra tatra . paryAptakAmasya#} ({%тот, кто положил конец своим желаниям%}) {#kftAtmanastu ihEva sarve pravilIyanti kAmAH ..#}\n<ls>MUṆḌ. UP. 3,2,2.</ls> {#SaSIva paryAptakalaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 6,44.</ls> {#paryAptacandreva SarattriyAmA#}\n<ls>KUMĀRAS. 7,26.</ls> {#paryAptapuzpastavakAvanamrA#}\n<ls n=\"KUMĀRAS.\">3,54.</ls> {#tasya dvArARi sarvARi paryAptAni bfhanti ca#}\n<ls>MBH. 15,186.</ls> {#urasyaparyAptaniveSaBAgA#} ({#lakzmIH#})\n<ls>RAGH. 18,46.</ls> {#nAtiparyAptamAlakzya matkukzeradya Bojanam#}\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">15,18.</ls> {#yajYAH paryAptadakziRAH#} (häufiger {#Aptada˚#})\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">17,17.</ls> {#aparyAptaM tadasmAkaM balam — paryAptaM tvidametezAM balam#}\n<ls>BHAG. 1,10.</ls> {#suparyAptaM kArayedgfhamAtmanaH#}\n<ls>M. 7,76.</ls> {#paryApto me varo hyeza yadahaM hariM dfzwavAn#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,13505.</ls> {#paryAptaBogA#}\n<ls>M. 3,40.</ls>\n<ls>YĀJÑ. 3,250.</ls> {#paryAptametAvadBartfsnehanidarSanam#}\n<ls>R. 5,25,20.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 5,\">81,24.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 5,81,\">42.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">2,38,10.</ls> {#paryAptaH parihAso 'yametAvat#} {%не продолжай шутку далее%}\n<ls>N. (BOPP) 11,8.</ls> {%достаточный%}, mit dem <ab>dat.</ab>: {#yasya trEvarzikaM BaktaM paryAptaM Bftyavfttaye#}\n<ls>M. 11,7.</ls> Die Ergänzung geht im <ab>comp.</ab> voran: {#mahendropakAraparyAptena vikramamahimnA#}\n<ls>VIKR. 11,11.</ls> {%действию%} (<ab>dat.</ab> или <ab>loc.</ab> des <ab>nom. act.</ab> или также <ab>inf.</ab>) или {%лицу%} (<ab>gen.</ab>) {%соответствующий, способный справиться%}: {#tvaM hi tasya vinASAya paryAptaH#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,13541.</ls> {#tadAtmaBaraRe — paryAptA madviDAnAM ca BaraRAya#}\n<ls>R. 2,31,23.</ls> {#ahamArya suparyApto vaDAyAsya#}\n<ls n=\"R.\">6,36,21.</ls> {#tvamevEkaH kAryasya parisADane . paryAptaH#}\n<ls n=\"R.\">5,35,46.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">3,42,26.</ls> {#anuyAtuM na paryApto garuqo vAyunA saha#}\n<ls n=\"R.\">3,44,30.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 3,\">35,25.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 3,\">51,7.</ls> <ls>RAGH. 10,26.</ls> <ls>PRAB. 75,2.</ls> {#rAmasya — na paryAptO#}\n<ls>R. 1,21,13.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">3,28,15</ls> <ls n=\"R. 3,\">42,25.</ls>\n<ls>MBH. 3,11281.</ls> {#paryAptam#} {%по желанию%}\n<ls>AK. 2,9,57.</ls>\n<ls>H. 1505.</ls> Gleichbedeutend mit {#paryApta#} ist {#paryAptavant#}\n<ls>RAGH. 16,28</ls> : {#pIqAmaparyAptavatIva soQum#} . — <ab>desid.</ab>"@ru ;
  pwglex:sourceGloss "<div n=\"1\">— 2) {%ein Ende machen, genug sein lassen%}: {#BIma paryApnuhi#}\n<ls>MBH. 15,1073.</ls> — <ab>part.</ab> {#paryApta#} {%erfüllt, zum Abschluss gebracht, das volle Maass habend, ein hohes Maass erreichend, geräumig, vollständig, voll, hinreichend, genügend%}: {#kAmAnyaH kAmayate manyamAnaH #}\n[Page1-0652]\n{# sa kAmaBirjAyate tatra tatra . paryAptakAmasya#} ({%der seine Begierden abgeschlossen hat%}) {#kftAtmanastu ihEva sarve pravilIyanti kAmAH ..#}\n<ls>MUṆḌ. UP. 3,2,2.</ls> {#SaSIva paryAptakalaH#}\n<ls>RAGH. 6,44.</ls> {#paryAptacandreva SarattriyAmA#}\n<ls>KUMĀRAS. 7,26.</ls> {#paryAptapuzpastavakAvanamrA#}\n<ls n=\"KUMĀRAS.\">3,54.</ls> {#tasya dvArARi sarvARi paryAptAni bfhanti ca#}\n<ls>MBH. 15,186.</ls> {#urasyaparyAptaniveSaBAgA#} ({#lakzmIH#})\n<ls>RAGH. 18,46.</ls> {#nAtiparyAptamAlakzya matkukzeradya Bojanam#}\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">15,18.</ls> {#yajYAH paryAptadakziRAH#} (häufiger {#Aptada˚#})\n<ls n=\"RAGH.\">17,17.</ls> {#aparyAptaM tadasmAkaM balam — paryAptaM tvidametezAM balam#}\n<ls>BHAG. 1,10.</ls> {#suparyAptaM kArayedgfhamAtmanaH#}\n<ls>M. 7,76.</ls> {#paryApto me varo hyeza yadahaM hariM dfzwavAn#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,13505.</ls> {#paryAptaBogA#}\n<ls>M. 3,40.</ls>\n<ls>YĀJÑ. 3,250.</ls> {#paryAptametAvadBartfsnehanidarSanam#}\n<ls>R. 5,25,20.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 5,\">81,24.</ls> <ls n=\"R. 5,81,\">42.</ls> <ls n=\"R.\">2,38,10.</ls> {#paryAptaH parihAso 'yametAvat#} {%treibe den Scherz nicht weiter%}\n<ls>N. (BOPP) 11,8.</ls> {%hinreichend%}, mit dem <ab>dat.</ab>: {#yasya trEvarzikaM BaktaM paryAptaM Bftyavfttaye#}\n<ls>M. 11,7.</ls> Die Ergänzung geht im <ab>comp.</ab> voran: {#mahendropakAraparyAptena vikramamahimnA#}\n<ls>VIKR. 11,11.</ls> {%einer Handlung%} (<ab>dat.</ab> oder <ab>loc.</ab> des <ab>nom. act.</ab> oder auch <ab>inf.</ab>) oder {%einer Person%} (<ab>gen.</ab>) {%gewachsen%}: {#tvaM hi tasya vinASAya paryAptaH#}\n<ls>MBH. 3,13541.</ls> {#tadAtmaBaraRe — paryAptA madviDAnAM ca BaraRAya#}\n<ls>R. 2,31,23.</